  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nSeries = 5, 11, 23, 47, ?\n\n**Logic use here:**\n\nPattern: Multiply by 2 and add 1\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n5 × 2 + 1 = 11\n\n11 × 2 + 1 = 23\n\n23 × 2 + 1 = 47\n\n⇒ 47 × 2 + 1\n\n⇒ 94 + 1\n\n⇒ 95\n\n**∴ The corrct answer is option (4).**",
